  m_text: "\r\r\nFito\r\nLead Game Designer\\nProject Manager\\n2D Vfx Art\r\n\r\nTirta\r\nGame
    Document Designer \\nGame Designer\r\n\r\nChae\r\nDialogue Writer\\nGame Designer\r\n\r\nRani\r\nCharacter
    Developer\\nNaration Developing\\nLead Game Design\r\n\r\nRafli\r\nResearch &
    Case Study\\nGame Designer\r\n\r\nMirza\r\nLevel Designer\\nGameDesigner\r\n\nAlvaro\r\nLead
    Artist\\nCharacter Sketch\\nCutscene Art\r\n\r\nNikken\r\nEnvironment Artist\r\n\r\nBagas\r\nEnvironment
    Artist\r\n\r\nAchdan\r\nUI/UX Artist\r\n\r\nModa\r\nCharacter Sketch\\nCutscene
    Art\\nConcept Art\r\n\r\nKenneth\r\nUI/UX Artist\r\n\r\nDaffa\r\nPixel Animator\\nCharacter
    Art\r\n\r\nHaidar\r\nPixel Animator\\n Character Art\r\n\r\nIrfan\r\nSound Effect
    Designer\r\n\r\nSatria\r\nSound Effect Designer\r\n\r\nMr. Amirul\r\nSound Effect\r\n\r\nKhaesa\r\nLead
    Audio /n BGM Composer\r\n\r\nUmar\r\nBGM Composer/nSound Effect\r\n\r\r\n\r\nAbdi\r\nLead
    Programming\\nSystem Integriate\\nLead Art Unity\\nUi Ux Designer\\nSound Programming\\nGame
    Feel Research\\n Lighting Art\r\n\r\nFaris\r\nEnvironment Art Unity\r\n\r\n\rVianda\r\nUI
    Implementation\r\n\r\nDedy\r\nUI Implementation\r\n\r\nMoreno\r\nMechanic System
    Programmer\r\n\r\nRevandya\r\nMechanic System Programmer\r\n\r\nRasyid\r\nMechanic
    System Programmer\r\n\r\nKhabib\r\nLead Enverintment Unity \\nEnvironment Artist
    Unity\r\n\r\nEdy\r\nCharacter, Camera, Control \r\n\r\nDirra\r\nCharacter, Camera,
    Control\r\n\r\nDzakiy\r\nStory Implementation\r\n\r\r\nRasyid\r\nStory Implementation\\nCutscene
    Integriate\r\n\r\nThankyou "
